---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_NAME } from '../config';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description={`What ${SITE_NAME} stores, what is public, and how to delete it.`}>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="program-head">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="lead">What we keep, what others can see, and how to remove it. Last updated October 24, 2026.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What we store</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Nothing about you until you post, follow a program or report a result. Then your browser gets an anonymous account, with no name or email.</li>
        <li>Your email address only if you choose to add one, so you can use the same account on other devices. It is never shown to anyone.</li>
        <li>A public name we create for you, such as "Steady Otter 0421", which you can change. It appears only on discussion posts.</li>
        <li>The results you report, the programs you follow, and whether you applied.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What other people can see</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Results, without anything that links them to you.</li>
        <li>Counts of how many people applied to or follow a program, never who.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we don't do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>No advertising trackers, and no selling or sharing of personal information.</li>
        <li>The only thing stored in your browser is your account session.</li>
        <li>To keep robots out, Cloudflare Turnstile checks that a real person is posting. It runs in the background and doesn't track you across sites.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Who helps us run the site</h2>
      <p>
        Pages are served by Cloudflare. Accounts and data are stored with Supabase. Each processes data only to run
        the site.
      </p>

      <h2>Removing your data</h2>
      <p>
        You can delete any result you reported from <a href="/me/">My programs</a>, and unfollow programs there too.
        {
          CONTACT_EMAIL ? (
            <span>
              To delete your account and everything linked to it, email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
            </span>
          ) : (
            <span>Deleting your whole account from the site is coming soon.</span>
          )
        }
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
